WeMM-Video support is ported from Tencent/WeMM-Video:
  source commit: 6cefad232b94e3e190d747251f35799b8b142213
  overlay: patch/vllm/0.31.0

The WeMM model/media modules and model-specific chat parser additions extend
vLLM under Apache-2.0. Original source notices are retained.
Local modifications adapt the multimodal processor hooks to this checkout
and preserve non-WeMM media dispatch. The ordinary vLLM LICENSE applies.

